Description:
    Adds the migration for the collaborative document tables. If the app
    uses import maps, it also adds pins to config/importmap.rb. The channel
    ships in the gem as LexxyRealtime::DocumentChannel, so the generator
    doesn't add one to the app.

Example:
    bin/rails generate lexxy_realtime:install

    This will create:
        db/migrate/XXXXXXXX_create_y_tables.rb
    The Y::Document and Y::DocumentUpdate models come from yrby-rails.
    The generator then reminds you to import "lexxy-realtime" from your
    JavaScript entrypoint.
